From 4a43e83aeb7e7944f0d284c9ecbfb38b4c1c725f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ADX12 upstream sync <adx12-sync@invalid.example>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 03:30:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] d3d12: admit content-addressed KosmicKrisp compute bundles

Route an explicitly requested, hash-bound compute pipeline through Mesa/KosmicKrisp-generated MSL. Keep DXMT Airconv as the unchanged fallback when no ADX12 bundle is requested, retain the root UAV allocation through command submission, and expose a versioned probe ABI so the harness can reject the host renderer.
